## OPEN items (honest — NOT green, all fail-closed / owner-gated)
- **OPEN-1 boot-order race test:** recovery-before-poller is correct by construction (code), but there is
  no dedicated test that injects a callback *during* boot and asserts it is reprocessed exactly once after
  ready. Risk: low (poller literally starts after recovery). Recommend adding before enabling live poll.
- **OPEN-2 C6 full resume state machine:** C6 has idempotent resume (`find_completed`) + admission
  atomicity (retract) + `verified-not-admitted`/`quarantined` verdicts, but NOT an explicit named durable
  `DETECTED→PENDING_ADMISSION→ADMITTED/RETRACTED` machine with per-transition crash tests. **C6 is not
  live** (no real research mission runs; proposal-only, owner-gated) so this is not on any hot path.
- **OPEN-3 24h parity soak:** the gate correctly *requires* ≥24h continuous, but no real 24h soak has
  elapsed — `PARITY-GREEN` has never (and must never yet) be asserted. Flag OFF.
- **OPEN-4 ACT/LEARN operation outbox:** real armed ACT needs an operation-level idempotency outbox+receipt
  before `ACT_ARMED` may be honored; `production_safe` currently blocks armed ACT entirely. Owner-gated.

